<title>UK: Birse jumps near 10 pct on yr profit rise.</title>
<headline>Birse jumps near 10 pct on yr profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Birse Group Plc rose nearly 10 percent on Tuesday after the property development company said pre-tax profits for the year ending April 30 were boosted by 80 percent to 2.02 million stg.</p>
<p>By 0859 GMT, Birse, which hit a six-month low of 20-1/2 on Monday, traded 2p higher at 23-1/4p.</p>
<p>&quot;The shares are up on the back of the figures, purely and simply,&quot; one market maker said.</p>
<p>Turnover rose to 409.90 million stg from 362.65 million stg, the company said.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
